  "id": "hypersensitivity",
  "term": "hypersensitivity",
  "definition": "Hypersensitivity is an unusually strong sensitivity to stimuli, especially sensory input such as light or sound. In the supplied psychology context, it is described as a common feature of autism spectrum disorder that can cause discomfort when the environment is not suitably adapted.",
